        17,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88c68cdf70d4404529008aad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这个虚拟现实之中，你的大脑所操控的\n是赛马娘的肉体。这是可以明确反映出\n你大脑潜能机能层级的肉体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b006c5e7a1773c78d9dc201e728c6450c5beb2bfbed70813c46d82b1c6ff430",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d2e3d6c0ef6b8aad08f5e56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df16dbad41a0fad4579780ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你只要和平常一样跑步就好了。\n也就是说，只要想着“跑”就会跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95be9e73c328a9cd1354ee00861066027fb33ddf3e8eb00678f55d006c72361b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c3ca6fb7d476bc8684a4293",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95698056e63b67bad559c9eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一次操作可能会有点困难，\n不过累积经验就会越来越上手的。\n总之首先要做的是先放松，明白了吗？",
